  <item>
    <title>004｜谁说人生不能走走停停，这时钟我偏要逆它</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66928c5637236c546ee6d63e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66928c5637236c546ee6d63e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 13 Jul 2024 14:16:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>终于艰难的剪出这期播客，自打录制后一直逃避再面对这个话题这几天反复的再次回听那天的对话想法又越来越清晰了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>好好享受夏天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">00:50</a> 我们都是为什么GAP了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="812">13:32</a> GAP后做了哪些工作时想做的事情，“好孩子”们想要的都很简单</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1083">18:03</a> GAP后的幸福瞬间，观察生活的细节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1766">29:26</a> 选择GAP你身边支持还是反对的声音多</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2158">35:58</a> 目前遇到的最大问题是什么，看看GAP的我们都被什么事情所困扰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2566">42:46</a> 听听非主流人群如何看待社会时钟的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3246">54:06</a> 在完全自由的情况下还能不能摆脱对意义感的执念</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3805">01:03:25</a> 失去工作的标签后我们会有身份危机吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4607">01:16:47</a> 上影节插曲引发的小思考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4898">01:21:38</a> GAP后会害怕和社会脱节吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5360">01:29:20</a> 正在GAP中的人怎么看GAP成为一种趋势</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM:Horace and pete</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lopFvssfjNK06CVFT0Ky00-5oF0-.m4a" length="108475900" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:50:57</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqr01nx0kWCv2CH_roeKDtC0XYLy.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>4</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>003｜生活的随想，一次路边的闲聊</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6672b8d5b6a8412729e4cd9b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6672b8d5b6a8412729e4cd9b</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 19 Jun 2024 10:54:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><p><span>临时起意的录制聊了聊最近的变化和问题，你可以听到我们的焦虑、不同的观点、乐观的心态，有新的想法也有一直讨论的话题，我们都比过去更爱自己了一点</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><span>梅雨季来了，愿阳光一直停留在大家心里</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><strong><span>痛苦是身体的想象。</span></strong></p></blockquote>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/loiqhNLv-3zp46vQxAb2b9ZnKEFU.m4a" length="55040835" type="audio/mp4"/>
